        "original_id": "85484511-ff12-5641-8c3d-a389726b4ca9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Angelspit, Blood on the Dance Floor, Lords of Acid\n- Albums: Hideous and Perfect\n- Places: United States, Orlando, Florida\n- Topics: tours, music releases\n\nFacts:\n- Blood on the Dance Floor is an American electronic music duo from Orlando, Florida, formed in 2006.\n- Hideous and Perfect is the third studio album by the Australian electro-industrial band Angelspit.\n- Angelspit performed with Lords of Acid during a 22-date U.S. tour in March 2011.\n- Angelspit toured the United States with Blood on the Dance Floor in October 2011.",
